{"word":"ἀφηγέομαι-οῦμαι","uri":"aphêgeomai-oumai","senses":[{"word":"ἀφηγέομαι-οῦμαι","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">ἀφ·ηγέομαι-οῦμαι,</span></span> <span class=\"ital\">f.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">ήσομαι,</span> conduire à partir d’un endroit,\n<span class=\"ital\">d’où :</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> marcher en tête à partir\nd’un point déterminé, <span class=\"ital\">d’où</span> <span class=\"ital\">en gén.</span> marcher en tête, <span class=\"ital\">p. opp.\nà</span> <span class=\"grec\">ἕπεσθαι,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Cyr.</span> <span class=\"refch\">2, 3, 10 ;</span> <span class=\"grec\">οἱ ἀφηγούμενοι,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Hell.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">4, 8, 37,</span> l’avant-garde ; <span class=\"ital\">p. suite,</span> guider, conduire, <span class=\"ital\">abs.</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Leg.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">760</span><span class=\"refpb\">d</span> ; <span class=\"ital\">avec un gén.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">ἀφ. ἀγέλης,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Arstt.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Mir.</span> <span class=\"refch\">10,</span> conduire un troupeau ; <span class=\"grec\">ἀποικίας,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Arstt.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">fr. 471,</span> une colonie ; <span class=\"grec\">πρεσϐείας,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Str.</span> <span class=\"refch\">47,</span> une ambassade ; <span class=\"ital\">fig.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">τῆς πολιτείας,</span> <span class=\"aut\">DS.</span> <span class=\"refch\">13, 42,</span> gouverner\nl’État ; <span class=\"grec\">τῶν πραγμάτων,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Jos.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">B.J.</span> <span class=\"refch\">2, 9, 1,</span> diriger les affaires (de l’État) ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> <span class=\"ital\">fig.</span> raconter du commencement à la fin, exposer en\ndétail, <sp